<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es"><head>
  <base href="../../">
<meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Mis solicitudes técnicas · Mi área · GarperLux</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" /><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400..700;1,9..144,400..700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" />
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<script>tailwind.config={theme:{extend:{colors:{ink:'#0B0D12','ink-soft':'#1C1F26',graphite:'#40454F',paper:'#F7F3EC','paper-2':'#EFE9DE','paper-3':'#E4DCCA',line:'#E5DED0',filament:'#E8A545','filament-glow':'#FFC878',copper:'#B8753A',electric:'#1E3A8A',stock:'#16A34A',warn:'#DC2626',caution:'#D97706'},fontFamily:{serif:['Fraunces','Georgia','serif'],sans:['Inter','system-ui','sans-serif'],mono:['JetBrains Mono','monospace']}}}};</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/css/styles.css" />
<style>.nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;padding:.65rem .85rem;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;color:var(--graphite);transition:all .15s}.nav-item:hover{background:var(--paper-2);color:var(--ink)}.nav-item.is-active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-weight:500}</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-paper text-ink">
  <div data-component="site-header"></div>
<div class="container-x pt-5 pb-2"><nav class="text-xs font-mono text-graphite flex items-center gap-2"><a href="../../index.html" class="hover:text-ink">Inicio</a><span class="opacity-50">/</span><a href="area-personal.html" class="hover:text-ink">Mi área</a><span class="opacity-50">/</span><span class="text-ink">Mis solicitudes</span></nav></div>

<section class="container-x py-6 pb-20"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] gap-8 lg:gap-10">
<aside id="glx-sidebar" class="lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start" data-active="mis-solicitudes"></aside>

<main>
  <div class="flex items-end justify-between flex-wrap gap-4 mb-8">
    <div><div class="eyebrow text-copper mb-2">Servicios técnicos</div><h1 class="font-serif font-medium leading-[0.96]" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);">Mis solicitudes.</h1></div>
    <a href="../servicios/solicitar-tecnico.html" class="btn btn-primary">+ Nueva solicitud</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Solicitud activa destacada -->
  <div class="bg-ink text-paper rounded-2xl p-6 mb-5 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[300px] h-[300px] filament-glow opacity-30"></div>
    <div class="relative grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-5 items-start">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 flex-wrap"><span class="pill bg-warn text-paper">Avería</span><span class="pill pill-dark">Electricidad</span><span class="pill pill-info">En revisión</span></div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-paper/60 mb-1">GLX-2026-04-2748</div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium leading-tight mb-2">Salta el automático al enchufar el microondas</h2>
        <p class="text-paper/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">Recibida el 26/04/2026 a las 18:42 · Te llamaremos antes de las 22:42 hoy.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="../servicios/solicitud-confirmacion.html" class="btn btn-primary">Ver estado<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Histórico -->
  <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium mb-4 mt-8">Histórico</h2>
  <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
    <div class="divide-y divide-line">
      <div class="p-5 grid sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] gap-4 items-center">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-stock/15 text-stock grid place-items-center"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-graphite">GLX-2026-03-2104</span><span class="pill pill-stock text-[10px]">Resuelto</span></div>
          <div class="font-medium">Cambio de magnetotérmico defectuoso</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-graphite mt-0.5">Resuelto el 18/03/2026 · Técnico: Alfonso T.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-right"><div class="font-mono font-medium">125,40 €</div><a href="factura.html" class="text-xs text-copper hover:underline">Descargar factura</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 grid sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] gap-4 items-center">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-stock/15 text-stock grid place-items-center"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-graphite">GLX-2026-02-1487</span><span class="pill pill-stock text-[10px]">Resuelto</span></div>
          <div class="font-medium">Instalación de videoportero Wi-Fi</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-graphite mt-0.5">Resuelto el 22/02/2026 · Técnico: Pedro R.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-right"><div class="font-mono font-medium">298,00 €</div><a href="factura.html" class="text-xs text-copper hover:underline">Descargar factura</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 grid sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] gap-4 items-center">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-graphite/10 text-graphite grid place-items-center"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-graphite">GLX-2026-01-0892</span><span class="pill pill-warn text-[10px]">Cancelado</span></div>
          <div class="font-medium">Revisión preventiva anual</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-graphite mt-0.5">Cancelado por el cliente el 15/01/2026</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-right text-graphite text-sm">Sin coste</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA Hazlo Tú Mismo -->
  <div class="mt-8 bg-paper-2 border border-copper/30 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4">
    <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-copper text-paper grid place-items-center shrink-0"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/></svg></span>
    <div class="flex-1">
      <h3 class="font-medium mb-1">Antes de pedir un técnico, mira si lo puedes resolver tú</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-graphite mb-3">Muchas dudas se resuelven en 10 minutos con la guía adecuada. Si no, llámanos.</p>
      <a href="../aprender/hazlo-tu-mismo.html" class="link-underline text-sm">Ir a Hazlo Tú Mismo</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</div></section>
  <div data-component="site-footer"></div>

<script src="../../assets/js/main.js"></script><script src="../../assets/js/auth.js"></script>
<script>if(glxRequireAuth()){const u=glxGetUser();if(u.role==='pro'){location.href='area-personal.html';}else{document.querySelector('[data-current-name]') && (document.querySelector('[data-current-name]').textContent=u.name);const sb=document.getElementById('glx-sidebar');sb.innerHTML=glxRenderSidebar(sb.dataset.active);}}</script>
  <script src="../../assets/js/component-loader.js"></script>
  <script src="../../data/api.js"></script>
  <script src="../../assets/js/backend-integration.js"></script>
  <script src="../../assets/js/catalog-ui.js"></script>
</body></html>
